### PACS Bridge — uji API key dengan REST Client (VS Code)
### 1. Pilih environment di status bar REST Client: "live" (10.4.0.10) atau "local" (127.0.0.1:8081)
### 2. Variabel baseUrl & apiKey diambil dari http-client.env.json (jangan di-commit)
### 3. Klik "Send Request" di atas tiap blok

@acc = A261105038

### 1) Health — status Orthanc + status worklist
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 2) Daftar worklist (order yang menunggu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/worklists
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 3) Study hari ini (limit 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/recent?date=today&limit=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 4) Cari study by accession
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies?accession={{acc}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 5) Gambar JPEG by accession (respons biner)
GET {{baseUrl}}/studies/{{acc}}/jpg?quality=90
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 6) Kirim order uji -> 201 Created
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/worklists
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_name": "TES RESTCLIENT",
  "title": "Tn.",
  "patient_id": "TEST-RC-01",
  "accession_number": "TESTRC261113",
  "procedure": "THORAX PA"
}

### 7) Hapus order uji (id diambil dari respons request 6) — jalankan setelah request 6
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/worklists/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 8) Ubah pengaturan -> harus 403 dengan API key (sengaja diblokir)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "server_ip": "10.4.0.10"
}

### 9) Tanpa API key -> harus 401 (pakai environment "live-key-salah", atau hapus baris header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
